WEBVTT

00:07:54.054 --> 00:08:00.050
boshqalarga qaraganda 
ko'proq vaqt topdim.

00:08:00.050 --> 00:08:04.078
Pirovard maqsadimiz - koinotning 
to'liq nazariyasini ishlab chiqish

00:08:04.078 --> 00:08:10.184
va biz bunda 
katta natijalarga erishmoqdamiz.

00:08:10.184 --> 00:08:14.476
E'tiboringiz uchun rahmat.

00:08:14.476 --> 00:08:17.843
Kris Anderson: Professor, 
aytingchi, biz chindan ham

00:08:17.843 --> 00:08:21.670
Somon Yo'lida yolg'izmizmi, 



00:08:21.670 --> 00:08:25.022
bizdek yoki undan ham 
yuqori darajada rivojlangan

00:08:25.022 --> 00:08:45.036
sivilizatsiyalar yo'qmi?